DATA ATTRIBUTION

The model weights embedded in this project (model/model.json, and the model data
inlined into index.html) were trained from data/xAPI-Edu-Data.csv, obtained from
Kaggle and published under CC BY-SA 4.0, copyright of the original authors:

  Amrieh, E. A., Hamtini, T., & Aljarah, I. (2016). Mining Educational Data to
  Predict Student's Academic Performance using Ensemble Methods. International
  Journal of Database Theory and Application, 9(8), 119-136.

The dataset and this project's code are separately licensed: the code is MIT, the
data is CC BY-SA 4.0. The MIT licence above applies to the code only and does not
extend to the dataset.